  <item>
    <title>通关撒花・影之刃零丨这一切原来都是你的阴谋！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6af9d1befe62f8f52c4ba0b1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6af9d1befe62f8f52c4ba0b1</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《影之刃零》终于正式发售了，作为大量玩家翘首以盼的作品，这款游戏究竟是否达到了我们的期待？时央和RED先后通关了本作，决定在本期节目中聊聊各自的感受。究竟是量大管饱还是过犹不及，且听我们慢慢道来。</span></p><p><span>▽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="72">01:12</a> 整体感受</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="624">10:24</a> 关卡地图</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1692">28:12</a> 战斗系统</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4096">01:08:16</a> 探索收集</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4650">01:17:30</a> 主线流程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7479">02:04:39</a> 支线任务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9297">02:34:57</a> 任务引导</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9630">02:40:30</a> 总结陈词</span></p><p><span>▽</span></p><p><span>主播：RED、时央</span></p>]]></description>
